# Agent harness — daily-magic

Bootstrap: **`rules-harness-bootstrap.mdc`** + **`npm run harness:bootstrap`** (manifest: **`.cursor/harness/agent-bootstrap.manifest.json`**).

Invariants: **`rules-bundle-core.mdc`**. Git hooks: **`npm run harness:bootstrap -- --workflow=commit`**.

Tailwind CSS 4 — not SCSS modules. No EnergyCenter Jira/Bitbucket/Sentry/React Router patterns unless reintroduced.
